Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.95,0:00:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安-科曼奇-苏贝斯克萨塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soobesukutsa tua pia mupitsI iku kimai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.33,0:00:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说 很久很久之前 这里曾经有怪物怪兽出没\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time ago, it is said, a monster came here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一头白尾鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}A white tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.45,0:03:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起抓住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mahoinitude{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fn文鼎古印体繁\fs14\fsp20\alpha&H82&\pos（205，90）\1c&H9F9F9F&}铁血 战士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:06:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍记得当时父亲对我说 准备好了就可以参加试炼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember when Father told me I was ready for kuhtaamia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.25,0:06:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于我的狩猎行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}My big hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.25,0:06:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候你还很小 所以妈妈带你去采药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were little. So, Mother took you to gather medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但父亲和我一起进入深山\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Father and I, we went up into the hills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.95,0:06:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天的雨很大 到处都湿漉漉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rain was bad. Everything was wet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在泥地里缓慢爬行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We crawled thr ough the mud and my bowstring{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我的弓弦也坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}got ruined and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were sleeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等着它盘旋回来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was waiting for it to circle back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跨河去把猎物捡回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're gonna have to cross the river to get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把弓弦弄湿了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get your bowstring wet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taabe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上在天空中\N{\fnArial\fs30}this morning in the sky, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了一个雷鸟预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a sign. The thunderbird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在刻苦练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been practicing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了 我准备好了 可以参加试炼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time. I'm ready for my kuhtaamia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.91,0:06:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的觉得自己准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think you're ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想猎杀那些视你为猎物的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna hunt something that's hunting you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs15\pos（192，250）\fscy110\2c&H000000&}北方大平原 1719年9月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Petsu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.05,0:09:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把狗训得挺好 - 很容易 这条狗很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trained him well. - It's easy. He's smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明的生灵也不一定好训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not every smart creature is easy to train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.47,0:09:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是用来给老作战酋长治膝盖的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that for War Chief's bad knee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的情况越来越糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没放橙花\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't put orange totsiyaa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁教你要放橙花的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who taught you about orange totsiyaa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲给你留的这把斧头 是让你砍面包树根的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father left you that to cut breadroot with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.72,0:09:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点用这把斧头猎到一只白尾鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost got a deer with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好吧 我们不能煮 差点 来吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, we can't eat "almost."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.09,0:09:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你的特长可以做其他很多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}My girl, you are good at so many other things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么非要去狩猎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you want to hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们都认定我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you all think that I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天这么大的风 他都能猎一只红尾鹰回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this wind, he brings home a red-tail{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该好好听我给你讲故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have listened to my story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们没时间小憩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't think we had time for a nap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Posa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,够锋利了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sharp enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.63,0:10:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,去采些橙花回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get us some orange totsiyaa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Itsee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么啦 - 普瑞被一头狮子抓走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hina? - A lion. It took Puhi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到那头狮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷偷摸摸地跟过来 就不怕被射到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could get shot sneaking up like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁偷偷摸摸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's sneaking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人邀请你来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who invited you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这次狩猎用不了多久 不需要人做饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't be gone long enough to need a cook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.33,0:13:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她留下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很擅长追踪猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tracks well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果普瑞还活着 她也会用药\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we find Puhi alive, she knows medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定得把那头狮子找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to find that cat now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.29,0:13:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会找到的 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你一定要找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.87,0:14:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 很好 狗找到了一坨屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good. The dog found shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.46,0:14:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要找的可不是狼 - 这不是狼的粪便\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not looking for wolves. - It's not wolf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那块碎掉的骨头了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that crushed bone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是狮子的粪便\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's lion scat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下这摊粪便的狮子个头可不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the cat that made it was big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.79,0:15:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,做担架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Petsu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给他吃这么多 会毒死他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much could kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.83,0:16:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 这样能减缓他的血液循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't kill him. Just cool his blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好冷 好冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anaa. Anaa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔比想留下来狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taabe wants to stay and hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.75,0:16:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你一起去 - 一头狮子而已 我能应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm coming with you. - I can handle the lion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不止一头狮子那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not just the lion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,普瑞为什么还活着 是有更危险的东西把狮子吓跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is Puhi alive? There's something that scared the cat away from its den.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.71,0:16:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟着普瑞吧 他也需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with Puhi. He needs your help too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间废话了 得赶紧送他回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time to waste talking. We need to get him home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.21,0:16:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manamusohi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好冷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}uts'tu nu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.71,0:17:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,停一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobo'ihupitu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.87,0:17:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.96,0:17:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他体温降低就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cold is good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.21,0:17:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,药能降低血流速度 如果体温过高他会失血而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The medicine slows his blood. If he gets warm, he'll bleed out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想让他舒服还是希望他活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want him to be comfortable or alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time to wait for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们看 - 可能是熊的足迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look. - Could be bear tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.99,0:18:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这头熊的块头可真够大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's a big bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,熊为什么只用后腿走路呢 什么东西会这样给蛇剥皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why was it on its hind legs? And what skins a snake like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.49,0:18:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得继续赶路 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to keep moving. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去提醒我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to warn my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:18:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕卡 你跟她一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paaka, go with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.37,0:20:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露 不要点火把 会吓到狮子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naru, we don't need the torches. They'll scare the cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在它的狩猎场里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in its hunting grounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了足迹 很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found tracks, and they were huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.99,0:20:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不怕熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not frightened by a bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.41,0:20:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉不是熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it was a bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道是什么东西 我从来没见过这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what it was. I've never seen anything like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西剥了一条蛇的皮 还把蛇的内脏掏空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It skinned and gutted a snake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.45,0:20:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那是什么东西 我们现在身处狮子的巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever it was, we're in the cat's den now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都得先把狮子干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to deal with it first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.82,0:20:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.37,0:20:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,狮子不会觉得我们在捕猎它\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lion won't think that we're hunting it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.87,0:20:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它觉得它在捕猎我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll think it's hunting us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备好诱饵 然后爬到树上等着就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get some bait, then climb up and wait for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人不会等待只会狩猎 我们说不定会等上一整夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hunter doesn't wait. He hunts. We could be here all night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在森林中潜行一夜 也可能会一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could stalk the forest all night and not find anything too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.62,0:20:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你畏首畏尾不敢狩猎 那就回营地去吧 那才是你该待的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're too afraid to hunt, go back to camp where you belong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.57,0:21:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来试试娜露的建议吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll try it Naru's way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,布下诱饵 我会把狮子引到你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll bait it, then I'll lead the cat to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.87,0:21:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了 娜露\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time, Naru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.87,0:21:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的试炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your kuhtaamia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.45,0:21:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,狮子来了之后 你告诉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the lion comes, you tell that thing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.74,0:21:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,“到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This is as far as you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.37,0:21:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要终结了 这是你的尽头”\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more. This is it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不敢用这斧头 那它再锋利又有何用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't matter how sharp it is if you're too afraid to use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.87,0:22:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉自己已经准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来没有面对过狮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never faced a lion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,它嘴里的牙齿如箭般锋利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its mouth full of teeth like arrows, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.49,0:22:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,时刻准备着撕下你的血肉 咬断你的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}ready to tear your flesh and crush your bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.41,0:22:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥回来之后我和他会找到那头狮子 然后宰了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your brother comes back, he and I will find the lion and kill it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:23:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你哥哥背你回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother carried you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.07,0:24:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那头狮子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha- What about the lion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.49,0:24:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塔比在追踪它 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Taabe went after it. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.24,0:24:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 你得好好休养\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you need to rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ihka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这杯茶喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink this tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.91,0:24:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ihka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.70,0:24:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了你的药 普瑞才能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Puhi survived because of your medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.37,0:24:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里还有别的东西 我得去帮塔比\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something else out there. Taabe needs my help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.99,0:24:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你哥哥需要你帮忙 那他就不会带你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your brother needed you, he wouldn't have brought you back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.32,0:24:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为试炼是为了证明你狩猎的能力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the reason for kuhtaamia is to prove you can hunt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.99,0:24:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 试炼的目的只有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's only one reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.57,0:24:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.32,0:25:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔比回来了 塔比回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taabe kima! Taabe kima!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.49,0:27:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 娜露 - 作战酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Naru. - War Chief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.74,0:27:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.99,0:27:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.12,0:27:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.53,0:27:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.45,0:27:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.03,0:27:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为是什么东西留下了那些足迹还剥掉了蛇皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think left those tracks and skinned that snake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.91,0:27:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我掉下去之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And before I fell, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.16,0:27:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看到树影之间有闪电 - 娜露\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw lightning in the trees. - Naru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.03,0:27:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那里还有别的东西 - 如果真的有 我会将其猎杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's something else out there. - And if there is, I'll get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.99,0:27:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得再回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to go back out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.28,0:27:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要远行 越过山脊 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Far, beyond the ridgeline. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.41,0:27:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 那这次狩猎我就一个人去 - 你没那个能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Well, I'll hunt alone if I have to. - You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.37,0:27:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 作战酋长 我得到你的批准才行吗 - 这跟批不批准没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do I need your permission, War Chief? - It's not about permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.16,0:27:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没那个能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.45,0:27:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一路背你回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to carry you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.32,0:27:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.20,0:27:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.16,0:27:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.78,0:27:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.24,0:28:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试过了 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried it. You just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.91,0:28:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没能成功将猎物杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't bring it home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.67,0:29:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然他们瞧不起我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they don't see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.42,0:29:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就证明给他们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}then show them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.59,0:29:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kima.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.43,0:34:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次换你来做饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, you're cooking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.43,0:34:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kima.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.89,0:34:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像希望一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numa'ai kima.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.97,0:34:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那些脚印是什么东西留下的我们都要把它找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go find whatever left those tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.31,0:34:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}uhkitsi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.39,0:36:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,南无宝髻如来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tasiwoo Atsabi, yutsu tsaaku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.47,0:36:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,静心轮回 安息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}urako taa ahpu yuhmuku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.56,0:37:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarii?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.22,0:41:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.32,0:46:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们来这里做什么 - 找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here? - Looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.36,0:46:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥让我们来带你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother sent us to bring you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.28,0:46:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.36,0:46:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这条路的另一头找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Searching for you on the other side of the pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.57,0:46:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.73,0:46:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看到它了 - 看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw it. - Saw what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.19,0:46:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到留下那些足迹的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what left those tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.73,0:46:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那头熊吗 - 确实有一头熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The bear? - There was a bear, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.15,0:46:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有别的东西 那东西块头很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there was something else, and it was huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.32,0:46:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西被血覆盖之后 我才看到它 但它看起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't see it until it was covered in blood, but it looked like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.48,0:46:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一只怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a mupitsI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.03,0:46:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是童话里的怪兽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw a monster from a children's story?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.28,0:46:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西赤手空拳杀一头熊 易如反掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It fought and killed a bear with its hands, easily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.28,0:46:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那它怎么没杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come it didn't kill you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.32,0:47:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.48,0:47:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.57,0:47:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.90,0:47:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aitu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.90,0:47:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想走对吧 成全你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna leave? Then leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.90,0:47:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.57,0:48:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.15,0:48:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.78,0:48:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.98,0:48:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的武器也得用绳子拴着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a leash for your weapon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.94,0:48:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,去打点水 我们休息一会儿 别走太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some water. We'll rest a minute. Stay together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.03,0:48:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塔比呢 - 我们到营地汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about Taabe? - He'll meet us back at camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.94,0:48:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了别走太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said stay together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.78,0:48:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想拉屎 你要我在这里拉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go take a squat. You want me to do it here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.61,0:48:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.19,0:49:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看你那满脸的惊惧之色\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.19,0:49:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为负鼠是被什么吓过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think drove the possums our way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.85,0:50:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 快给我松绑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Cut me loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.06,0:50:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.35,0:53:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.95,0:54:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们瞄准它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.12,0:54:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是它瞄准了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He has us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.87,0:55:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regardez ici.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.25,0:55:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regardez ici.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.25,0:55:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Une femme{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.83,0:55:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qu'est-ce qu'elle fait ici?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.41,0:55:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Je vais la porter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.29,0:55:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会拖累我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elle va nous ralentir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.83,0:55:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她在跑 我想她看到了那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non. Par la fa?on qu'elle courait, je crois qu'elle l'a vu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.41,0:56:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是你的新金发女郎 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'est ton nouveau blonde, hein?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.79,0:56:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那该死的狗弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Degagez-moi ce putain de chien!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.79,0:56:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarii?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.50,0:57:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}J'ai pas un bon sentiment avec{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.83,0:57:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,水牛是你们杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed the buffalo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.08,0:57:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 现在要你付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'es fachee? Maintenant, tu vas payer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.12,0:57:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先看看她知道点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}On va voir qu'est-ce qu'elle sait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.83,0:57:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说话 你这个肮脏的野人-你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Parle, sale Raphael. - Qu'est-ce que tu fais ici, hein?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.37,0:57:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个陷阱吗 这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- C'est un piege? - Qu'est-ce qui se passe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.35,0:58:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.56,0:58:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会说很多种语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I speak a lot of languages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.52,0:58:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是科曼奇人 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Comanche, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.02,0:58:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了她 不 不 不 不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Je vais la tuer. - Non, non, non, non, non, non, non.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.68,0:58:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仍然可以使用她\N{\fnArial\fs30}On peut toujours l'utiliser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.68,0:58:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.52,0:58:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be helping us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.81,0:58:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉那东西在狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this creature is a hunter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.10,0:58:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在寻找最凶猛的野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for the strongest beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.68,0:58:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.93,0:58:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它把你的同伴都杀死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It killed your whole party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.56,0:58:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让她惨叫哀求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Je vais la faire chanter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.48,0:58:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.18,0:58:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't kill everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.18,0:58:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,识相的话 就来帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were smart, you'd help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.60,0:58:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把野人带进来 - 把他弄进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sors le sauvage. Sortez-lui de la sacree bo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.06,0:59:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.27,0:59:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会抓到其他人 你会帮我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}on ou d'une autre, tu vas nous aider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.35,0:59:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他放血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fais-le saigner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.52,0:59:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.64,0:59:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，他们只是试图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.31,0:59:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有病吧 我们不应该带马匹来\N{\fnArial\fs30}On n'aurait pas d? amener les chevaux.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.60,0:59:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它们闭嘴 否则那怪兽不会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fais-les taire ou la bete ne viendra pas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.14,1:00:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.93,1:00:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些白人想要抓的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing the white men are trying to catch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.64,1:00:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你当初出来找的那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that's what you went out after?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.98,1:00:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时追踪的就是它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's what you were tracking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.23,1:00:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.98,1:00:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想靠猎杀它来通过狩猎测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what you chose for kuhtaamia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.14,1:00:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这畜生怪兽在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elle est ou cette pute de bete?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.27,1:00:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了 我需要撒尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- J'ai faim et j'ai besoin de pisser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.39,1:00:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Qu'est-ce qui arrive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.69,1:00:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 不 不 发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, non, non, non. Qu'est-ce qui se passe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.14,1:00:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 - 怎么了 朗贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Qu'est-ce qui arrive? - Qu'est-ce qui arrive? Rambert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.19,1:00:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,太恐怖了 朗贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tire, Rambert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.52,1:00:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merde.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.06,1:01:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去找一匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get me a horse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.44,1:01:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Il est la!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.81,1:01:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了 它来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's coming. - Il est la!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.19,1:01:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oru posa kwitapu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.52,1:01:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.89,1:01:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你解得开你那边的绳子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get your side loose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.48,1:01:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.56,1:02:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是诱饵 它来找我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the bait. He's coming for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.19,1:02:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.94,1:02:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 它想要的不是诱饵 这不是它的狩猎之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It doesn't want bait. It doesn't hunt that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.94,1:02:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些捕兽者抓到我之前 它就看到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the trappers captured me, it saw me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.14,1:02:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它径直走到我面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came right up to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.77,1:02:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.81,1:02:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它感觉我没有丝毫威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't think I was a threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.60,1:02:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么杀死那只狮子的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know how I killed that lion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.77,1:02:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前的计划是潜伏在树上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your plan. The tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.31,1:02:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的计划的确削弱了它的实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weakened it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.52,1:02:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露 你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had it, Naru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.69,1:02:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忽略的地方 你往往都能捕捉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see what I miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.39,1:02:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.94,1:02:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道那东西是不是不死之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that this thing can be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.89,1:03:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要它还会流血 我们就能杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it bleeds, we can kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.31,1:03:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maintenant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.35,1:03:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.27,1:03:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naru!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.29,1:03:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,发财了 哈哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}est devenu riche ha ha ha{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.39,1:03:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salopard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.69,1:05:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.90,1:05:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有办法了 蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a plan. Get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.52,1:05:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得小时候的那场洪水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember the flood when we were young?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.40,1:05:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到一只河狸 它的腿卡在了两块石头之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a beaver that had its legs pinned between two rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.10,1:05:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,水位上升得很快 它知道自己快要被淹死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water was rising so fast, it knew it was going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.85,1:05:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是它咬断了自己的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it chewed off its own leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.77,1:05:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tirez!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.60,1:05:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会误打到其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}On va frapper les autres!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.06,1:05:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tirez!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.69,1:06:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对河狸来说 只要能逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was worth it to the beaver{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.02,1:06:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.10,1:06:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去一条腿也值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}losing its leg to be free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.81,1:06:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Naru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.60,1:06:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露 你要做什么 娜露 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, Naru? Naru, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.44,1:06:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可比河狸聪明多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm smarter than a beaver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.44,1:06:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们得赶紧离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we gotta go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.94,1:06:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪儿 - 我去找两匹马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - I gotta go get us those horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.10,1:06:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找萨里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get Sarii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.15,1:07:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开 快闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}ecartez. ecartez-vous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.65,1:08:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有点讨厌是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hatons-nous un peu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.35,1:08:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}J'ai besoin d'aide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.48,1:08:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们帮不了他们 我们只需要继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}On peut rien faire pour eux. Simplement on doit continuer d'avancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.02,1:08:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那狗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Et le chien?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.15,1:08:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}J'aime le chien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.02,1:08:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道比海狸好\N{\fnArial\fs30}ca goute mieux que le castor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.52,1:09:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.06,1:09:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己找个地方躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owehkimia, Taabe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.19,1:09:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.51,1:10:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.63,1:10:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有药吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have medicine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.80,1:10:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你救我 我就教你怎么用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, and I'll show you how to use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.67,1:10:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.63,1:10:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.30,1:11:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起火药 倒进枪管里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the powder and put it in the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.05,1:11:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要太多 也不要太少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too little, not too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.88,1:11:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.97,1:11:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后拿起弹丸和布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you take the ball and the cloth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.22,1:11:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也都放进枪管里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it in the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.84,1:11:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用那个小棍子\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, take the stick you see there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.67,1:11:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,往枪管里捅三、四次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put in the gun, uh, three, four times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.09,1:11:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.97,1:11:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.59,1:11:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.38,1:11:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,往这里放一点火药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put powder here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.63,1:11:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后扣击那东西 枪就开火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then pull that back and it will fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.05,1:12:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.59,1:12:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我 好疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. It hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.01,1:12:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.13,1:12:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.22,1:12:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我感觉好冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? I'm freezing cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.13,1:12:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.22,1:12:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要丢下我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.81,1:14:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西看不见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.44,1:15:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.77,1:15:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要太多 也不要太少\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Not too much, not too little."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.14,1:16:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isa'ai!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.81,1:16:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.69,1:16:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taabe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.23,1:16:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Naru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.19,1:16:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它认定我有威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It thinks I'm the threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.19,1:16:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is as far as I go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.27,1:16:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结了 我死了就一切都完结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more. This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.69,1:16:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 回家去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Bring it home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.35,1:20:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 啊 不 不 滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non! Ah, non! Non, arrete!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.65,1:20:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.28,1:21:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤了我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bled my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.41,1:21:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.37,1:21:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiote sauvage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.57,1:21:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我的狩猎技能没有你们的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that I am not a hunter like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.74,1:21:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至不知道你犯了什么错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tu ne sais meme pas l'erreur que tu viens de faire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.66,1:21:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不是威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I am not a threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.62,1:21:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把子弹射进你的脑袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Je vais mettre une balle dans ton crane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.24,1:21:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,低估我 所以我才更危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what makes me dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.32,1:21:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死的 婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tu vas mourir, chienne!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.41,1:21:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你意料不到我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't see that I'm killing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.78,1:22:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西也意料不到我要杀它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it won't either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.74,1:22:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.12,1:22:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.28,1:26:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Petsu!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.70,1:27:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧 来吧 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.45,1:27:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.78,1:27:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.57,1:27:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能到这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is as far as you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.16,1:27:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.12,1:27:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.28,1:28:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露姐姐回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naru iku kima!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.24,1:28:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿鲁卡奶奶 阿鲁卡 娜露回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aruka iku! Aruka, Naru kima.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.74,1:28:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜露回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naru kima.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.87,1:28:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hina ma yaa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.70,1:28:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hina ma yaa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.96,1:29:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,1715年 拉斐尔·阿多里尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rou の Studio{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.23,1:29:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is danger nearby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.50,1:29:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得搬到更容易布防的地方去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to move to easier protected ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.25,1:30:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,依吉姆·托马斯与约翰·托马斯的角色改编\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rou の Studio{\r}
